<title>JAPAN: Yasuda Trust posts 6-mth stock appraisal loss.</title>
<headline>Yasuda Trust posts 6-mth stock appraisal loss.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yasuda Trust &amp; Banking Co Ltd said on Monday that it had appraisal losses of 4.63 billion yen on its securities holdings as of September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>But the bank said in a statement that it does not expect to make a major change in its earnings forecast for the six months to that date.</p>
</text>
